{"id":"b64f5518ecc7bece21bd522b397c118d3755cfb4019e80dad9b2ff0a62fb975c","pubkey":"678a308e59c24ee1b342b0fe9abdf6fdfa5dccc30aeb275a537e1f7fa0609fbc","created_at":1782264061,"content":"Saw this at the Nats game. \n\nA Decentralized economy needs decentralized money. Terra.\n\nPretty sure they dont take bitcoin here though.\n\nhttps://cdn.nostrcheck.me/6ff57fe35713353f87dd49a120f61ca12815509ae8e39b43e184ed2246ddb92e.jpeg","tags":[["alt","A short note: Saw this at the Nats game. \n\nA Decentralized econo..."],["r","https://cdn.nostrcheck.me/6ff57fe35713353f87dd49a120f61ca12815509ae8e39b43e184ed2246ddb92e.jpeg"],["imeta","url https://cdn.nostrcheck.me/6ff57fe35713353f87dd49a120f61ca12815509ae8e39b43e184ed2246ddb92e.jpeg","x 6ff57fe35713353f87dd49a120f61ca12815509ae8e39b43e184ed2246ddb92e","size 271473","m image/jpeg","dim 924x2000","blurhash [AE.hVR.Ipxu0pbJR+j[=.oLM|WBV-NGs:WBISadWUWVtoRjjZWBxzj]tQWCS%ogayofDz%2xtWC","ox 6ff57fe35713353f87dd49a120f61ca12815509ae8e39b43e184ed2246ddb92e"],["client","Amethyst"]]}
