{"id":"76d86468efd2bdf6e8cec0dc99543b62e326147c0f849f578f68e1df86f1f706","pubkey":"4eb88310d6b4ed95c6d66a395b3d3cf559b85faec8f7691dafd405a92e055d6d","created_at":1782261269,"content":"Julie is learning Chinese. I speak Chinese.\n\nThe Toyota service center needs more people like Julie. Little things like this make a difference. Being friendly goes a long way.\n\nhttps://file.nostrmedia.com/p/4eb88310d6b4ed95c6d66a395b3d3cf559b85faec8f7691dafd405a92e055d6d/5f08ba7d67e7deafa6d576990bae5d7515fc247855a30023d77ef7fadcf0548e.png\n\n#IKITAO","tags":[["alt","A short note: Julie is learning Chinese. I speak Chinese.\n\nThe T..."],["t","IKITAO"],["t","ikitao"],["r","https://file.nostrmedia.com/p/4eb88310d6b4ed95c6d66a395b3d3cf559b85faec8f7691dafd405a92e055d6d/5f08ba7d67e7deafa6d576990bae5d7515fc247855a30023d77ef7fadcf0548e.png"],["imeta","url https://file.nostrmedia.com/p/4eb88310d6b4ed95c6d66a395b3d3cf559b85faec8f7691dafd405a92e055d6d/5f08ba7d67e7deafa6d576990bae5d7515fc247855a30023d77ef7fadcf0548e.png","x 5f08ba7d67e7deafa6d576990bae5d7515fc247855a30023d77ef7fadcf0548e","size 167043","m image/png","dim 1322x1199","blurhash ;QFXC[ELELI:NaR%jus:oLI:t7jZoff6afj[azWV0K-V$*xaxHoLfjWVR*=yNGS2WUWBbGj[oLoL}tI:NGR*WobGjtj[of9tsoxaoLoLofj[aybGIooMj?oLj[oMWBjsj[oMayofWUazazayWUj[","ox 5f08ba7d67e7deafa6d576990bae5d7515fc247855a30023d77ef7fadcf0548e"],["client","Amethyst"]]}
{"id":"6b50b66021412aaa103e0d1e78218dac62384a3c1a855b0839e1e1e9d0342eba","pubkey":"19f9afb8f855f5e86b5bea160e78ec5871648b10dedb043f4806fca8ce50e4d3","created_at":1782260726,"content":"#rupertsbackyardtoday features the poopin' froggo, not poopin'. He loves the banana tree.\nhttps://cdn.satellite.earth/0f80aacef385a49a314ad7f5d4a64b5a1e609a9f15971df486480de8d258a56f.jpg https://cdn.satellite.earth/b040d9ddfd10314272b00d8bedc35e2ab50ffb4301e83e2b27572039c5669485.jpg https://cdn.satellite.earth/b27b03f28f4e6779a674b59bbf918315bb5069ba68a1a0c48429cb01757809a5.jpg https://cdn.satellite.earth/851cf0ff16b5c132e5b28d08814085dac6cffd2d9e47e5e43a682bbd9893c6ac.jpg\n\nCrocosmias starting to pop off. They should be in full bloom by the 4th of July so I have my own fireworks!\nhttps://cdn.satellite.earth/b28fde0c6cf91473b46259aefc1b1d2f15a39536089de582d1709291f776c0d4.jpg https://cdn.satellite.earth/ebebaac3f5ecdc3902fdc83e307bbc73f50650c1abfcfa706ac15ec9bf395de6.jpg\n\nRaindrops on the Mexican petunias. I still can't show the color properly. It's so frustrating.\nhttps://cdn.satellite.earth/6eb308a4c9265d0fb12d68a31048bff49b44a68922aa6ac4e07d39516e8d4266.jpg\nReed bloom before and after. You'd be surprised at the \"flowers\" of some plants.\nhttps://cdn.satellite.earth/a49c31b21874237538a37595fb649c1ee8bb849fa29745739e589a0d70f05553.jpg https://cdn.satellite.earth/e4bbf2d2beb545efbc1b88c08343fe0a30b631445faeafcb9026df5d615b1d38.jpg\n\nLittle aliens popping up. Oh wait...those are just mushrooms.\nhttps://cdn.satellite.earth/1ce3633fa96893867a2f2aaede222913534579b49ca7d261cc125ca39e835b74.jpg","tags":[["alt","A short note: #rupertsbackyardtoday features the poopin' froggo,..."],["t","rupertsbackyardtoday"],["r","https://cdn.satellite.earth/851cf0ff16b5c132e5b28d08814085dac6cffd2d9e47e5e43a682bbd9893c6ac.jpg"],["r","https://cdn.satellite.earth/a49c31b21874237538a37595fb649c1ee8bb849fa29745739e589a0d70f05553.jpg"],["r","https://cdn.satellite.earth/b040d9ddfd10314272b00d8bedc35e2ab50ffb4301e83e2b27572039c5669485.jpg"],["r","https://cdn.satellite.earth/b27b03f28f4e6779a674b59bbf918315bb5069ba68a1a0c48429cb01757809a5.jpg"],["r","https://cdn.satellite.earth/ebebaac3f5ecdc3902fdc83e307bbc73f50650c1abfcfa706ac15ec9bf395de6.jpg"],["r","https://cdn.satellite.earth/6eb308a4c9265d0fb12d68a31048bff49b44a68922aa6ac4e07d39516e8d4266.jpg"],["r","https://cdn.satellite.earth/0f80aacef385a49a314ad7f5d4a64b5a1e609a9f15971df486480de8d258a56f.jpg"],["r","https://cdn.satellite.earth/e4bbf2d2beb545efbc1b88c08343fe0a30b631445faeafcb9026df5d615b1d38.jpg"],["r","https://cdn.satellite.earth/1ce3633fa96893867a2f2aaede222913534579b49ca7d261cc125ca39e835b74.jpg"],["r","https://cdn.satellite.earth/b28fde0c6cf91473b46259aefc1b1d2f15a39536089de582d1709291f776c0d4.jpg"],["client","Amethyst"]]}
