{"id":"30e2dc5a6798cc9d77d5fb52ac08a457fb90eaba3df66f329438f184b4d64fcf","pubkey":"edc615f59aa80e250fc00df64685a32cc08854c28d246f97c32ac5c9f3bb4c80","created_at":1782257716,"content":"https://blossom.primal.net/65ef3c2e0da25817a1eb8092caeb961d0b2f57c9a28ff9f9f562533b73d6c76c.png\nIn deserts pale where moonlight weaves, \nThrough lands unknown the cold winds sigh, \nThe sand recalls what time still grieves, \nBeneath the dark and ancient sky. \n\nLong vanished years in silence sleep, \nTheir echoes drift where shadows roam, \nWhile wandering souls the vigil keep, \nStill seeking lost and distant home. \n\nThe moon above the dunes burns white, \nOn forgotten roads no feet have known, \nIt guides the dead through endless night, \nAcross the wastes where they have flown. \n\nAnd in the sands of ages gone, \nWhere ruined stars and memories gleam, \nThe lost souls wander ever on, \nLike fading echoes in a dream. \n\n\nSweet dreams ✨️","tags":[["alt","A short note: https://blossom.primal.net/65ef3c2e0da25817a1eb809..."],["r","https://blossom.primal.net/65ef3c2e0da25817a1eb8092caeb961d0b2f57c9a28ff9f9f562533b73d6c76c.png"],["imeta","url https://blossom.primal.net/65ef3c2e0da25817a1eb8092caeb961d0b2f57c9a28ff9f9f562533b73d6c76c.png","x 65ef3c2e0da25817a1eb8092caeb961d0b2f57c9a28ff9f9f562533b73d6c76c","size 2167920","m image/png","dim 1536x1024","blurhash r55rAC.TM_MwI9I9ITRiogX:%hxuRPI9IAM_WBt8RNxvx^WBRiRPRiWAj[r;RiWWt8kXkCjsWBWAITI9RPtSx]xvt8ofaeRPRPV?a{xvx]xuj[Rj","ox 65ef3c2e0da25817a1eb8092caeb961d0b2f57c9a28ff9f9f562533b73d6c76c"],["client","Amethyst"]]}
