{"id":"55c9fbd7c81f8a1799d2864bc2e4b74bcc9983f69d109997227450b58977567a","pubkey":"7ed7d5c3abf06fa1c00f71f879856769f46ac92354c129b3ed5562506927e200","created_at":1782232397,"content":"Vibe learning android development with PI + Sonnet. I got it to make this site where all it needs to do is create and edit markdown files for each lesson and track progress. The agent is the program: we have a full collaboration protocol in the PI chat interface where it facilitates each lessons and makes exercises, with a fully-defined and flexible curriculum based on my goals (porting my golang nostr libs to kotlin, and creating nostr apps).\n\nThe best part is that I have to do all the course work myself, and everything is test-driven.\n\nYou can just make your own university.\n\nhttps://blossom.primal.net/a09cbc5483bbfd079992846e2663f1b5744e2cab8c4a0be347a09f2bd41af918.png\nhttps://blossom.primal.net/62c9201060fa0105d2eaad75fd5099694b43c5e4ebfa1a8b7f58b8d6ebbc39f0.png","tags":[]}
