{"id":"3e117afb58f88ffe46d99aa416e7f48dbfb222ae3cffa3c23137cb558958f197","pubkey":"1ea4ae8405ad5c6bd0dc35a0ac83e548c485142538e1e0c54ad40e5bb59a2ae8","created_at":1782232238,"content":"📇⬇️ policy: \n\nyes. from cj musil and jen musil on up to the highest forms of government. as for doge - all of the doge access to government systems has been revoked, and all clearance access issues patched and none of the private tech sector is supposed to be able to access high clearance government systems even with contracts - which is why government is supposed to train its own intelligence apparatuses and not rely on private contractors. the situation with doge is opaque to me and while i understand some of it, i do not think it was done properly and was done with internal fake elon and zillis backdoor blitz. purging identity rolls is not the job for lackey hacker interns and i maintain my stance the clarity surrounding the outcomes was limited. that said, i know the underlying reason was mercenary misuse of dead identity rosters in government databases - many of whom were funded goon squads from a variety of the arms of elon's equity rosters themselves. which makes sense why \"doge\" fake elon was so keen to cover his exploitation tracks. so its a both ways scenario - most of these large front tech companies which mask themselves as one thing and operate private armies on the backend are gloried bounty. and they all know they're in the end of days with their exploitation being acceptable. and i think body doubles are problematic and no one wants to admit that. i also want proof of life for elon musk. ☕️🗞️ \n\n\nhttps://x.com/elonmusk/status/2069445014787129590?s=46","tags":[["e","619dc1d5c489fd65871414972e2ee14dc13f8e659503980546307ed9ccc1b2a4","","root"],["e","b6d7d8e97cc1b325d9a12398c74e909320979450e30d39d89000eaf29f439db7","","reply"],["r","https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2069445014787129590?s=46"]]}
