{"id":"093f13fb1a3e83a6ea75affe5e585d760315e5a4e5d1eb4c24a672508b055354","pubkey":"fd0266485777bd73e97c7c37f520c83c82e362fe4c25a6be93f3380083d4646b","created_at":1782230897,"content":"It was getting hot in the printer room, so I repurposed an old inline fan. Helps when you can print your own custom ducting. \nhttps://npub1l5pxvjzhw77h86tu0sml2gxg8jpwxch7fsj6d05n7vuqpq75v34syk4q0n.blossom.band/eaf83e478795f5feceeaa433edb64a188d21c79a432b337f0ace9638c07e339f.jpg\n\nCouldn't make a hole in the wall there, but the door gave way easily. Not sure why I didn't think of that sooner. \nhttps://npub1l5pxvjzhw77h86tu0sml2gxg8jpwxch7fsj6d05n7vuqpq75v34syk4q0n.blossom.band/9627da3d0047593fbd46886a1ef35dbb8461f26e3d7e441a79dc54ac98ad3efc.jpg\nhttps://npub1l5pxvjzhw77h86tu0sml2gxg8jpwxch7fsj6d05n7vuqpq75v34syk4q0n.blossom.band/a0974b28a0db83759fa3c84e6e3cbc0d9eaaac2beb67dbed33456fdb0d28ef0c.jpg\nhttps://npub1l5pxvjzhw77h86tu0sml2gxg8jpwxch7fsj6d05n7vuqpq75v34syk4q0n.blossom.band/4e8a67957723151b0cefde588a07b8d43fd4a511070af436de41fec653263361.jpg\nIt looks hilarious, but it works.\n\nhttps://npub1l5pxvjzhw77h86tu0sml2gxg8jpwxch7fsj6d05n7vuqpq75v34syk4q0n.blossom.band/2a1a662a50218c5a39ac0ae3fc7c5e80684234f5cca0fe3710d0747ef1274f73.mp4","tags":[["client","Wisp"]]}
{"id":"f960e5a2075da75cbdb089c8f8695d6a96db4190b43a3e4711d43c4d339cb3e0","pubkey":"01d0bbf9537ef1fd0ddf815f41c1896738f6a3a0f600f51c782b7d8891130d4c","created_at":1782230742,"content":"Just noticed these right outside the front door earlier this morning.\nhttps://blossom.primal.net/632364cf0ba2d98b7bb360f7c7d0791d88200b7ccfd0bf40d65427dc9a344342.jpg","tags":[["e","0000672862091fe7ff225aa93f51fb9ef8e685cd134ab84dc3ab110b6ee955c9","wss://relay.primal.net/yonder-prism","root"],["e","4c784e924153145c75200ec137c756d4eed82da20fa5e208727a408ef482ac0b","","reply"],["p","8e27ffb5c9bb8cdd0131ade6efa49d56d401b5424d9fdf9a63e074d527b0715c","","mention"],["imeta","url https://blossom.primal.net/632364cf0ba2d98b7bb360f7c7d0791d88200b7ccfd0bf40d65427dc9a344342.jpg","m jpeg","dim 2047.0x2729.0"]]}
{"id":"e662e91192b962bd007c0bb10f10e5614bf48583954351141b8bbdcb41a858d6","pubkey":"d0cdc0f08a44b6d083bc3b84feb70761a0547bc55519a2738e0b0c34b85de648","created_at":1782230733,"content":"🎙️ New episode on nostr:npub16rxupuy2gjmdpqau8wz0adc8vxs9g77925v6yuuwpvxrfwzaueyqxq9ka5 \n\nSuffering From Success: When Winning Is Not Enough\n\nSounds ridiculous. Until it happens to you.\n\nMany Bitcoiners spent years seeing something others didn't - they took the risk, stayed convicted, endured the volatility.\n\nAnd eventually, they were right.\n\nBut Bitcoin often gives us more than wealth - itchanges how we think, what we value, and eventually the questions we ask ourselves.\n\nIf I've already won, now what?\n\nBrandon Hawk achieved his childhood dream by competing at Wimbledon and the U.S. Open before an injury forced him to reinvent himself. Today, he works with entrepreneurs, athletes, executives, and Bitcoiners navigating that same question.\n\nWith nostr:npub1syazeldyn2yqrcsma57z8q88smayett48hg4kxh3ngm6s92hj4usvagmnw , they explore identity beyond achievement, the hidden ceiling many successful people encounter, and what comes next when accumulation is no longer the only goal.\n\nThis episode is supported by nostr:npub1de3ks5m7pxs9f6wedn3947un3vr7fkhar777y9jszma2x9gfl6ysha93ql , whose work centers on a question many Bitcoiners eventually face:\n\nWhat do you do with the capacity you've built once accumulation is no longer the only goal?\n\nTune in below and join the conversation:\n\nWhat gives your life meaning beyond achievement? \n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jn_uIzX0uVA\nhttps://www.proofofheart.com/","tags":[["p","813a2cfda49a8801e21bed3c2380e786fa4cad753dd15b1af19a37a815579579"],["p","6e6368537e09a054e9d96ce25afb938b07e4dafd1fbde2165016faa31509fe89"],["client","Ditto","31990:781a1527055f74c1f70230f10384609b34548f8ab6a0a6caa74025827f9fdae5:ditto"]]}
